# Session handoff logs: kept on disk on purpose, never tracked. These are
# one-shot process records (and they contain local paths), so they live here
# rather than in the repository. Conclusions worth keeping belong in the source
# comments next to the code they explain.
.handoffs/

# WorkBuddy AI's own memory directory. That file belongs to the tool and stays
# at the path the tool expects it at; it is not part of this repository.
.workbuddy-ai/

# Local-only upload helper binary. Never part of the project.
/Tools/TelegramUploadEeveeSpotify
